stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "排队 queued" as Queued
    state "执行 running" as Running
    state "成功 succeeded" as Succeeded
    state "失败 failed" as Failed
    [*] --> Queued: 持久化创建
    Queued --> Running: 唯一执行者领取
    Queued --> Failed: 依赖失效
    Running --> Succeeded: 产物验证并发布
    Running --> Failed: 异常、超时或中断
    Succeeded --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    note right of Failed
        重试创建新的任务
        用 retry_of 关联原任务
        原失败终态不修改
    end note
